I left out both operations requests. This node's only granted authority is `aap:caps/state-rw`, and the crate has no filesystem or outbound HTTP capability. Adding either would widen the node's authority beyond its `with` clause. The metadata fetch would also send the input text to an external service. If you want those behaviors, they belong in a node that is explicitly granted the matching capability, or the grant needs to be changed in the graph.

